WEBVTT

00:05:58.397 --> 00:06:01.830
And as it seems the paint
is beginning to dry,

00:06:01.863 --> 00:06:03.097
I ask myself:

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.797
Do I really want all this?

00:06:07.063 --> 00:06:10.430
I mean, all of this, the fortune
and the fame and the celebrity?

00:06:10.463 --> 00:06:12.830
Because Dave Chappelle said
to David Letterman

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:16.063
that the more you invest
into yourself as a celebrity,

00:06:16.097 --> 00:06:18.463
the less of yourself you get to own.

00:06:21.863 --> 00:06:23.030
Hmm.

00:06:27.497 --> 00:06:28.830
And I asked myself: